<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of EU grain export/import commitments.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of EU grain export/import commitments.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of January 28 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On January 30, the EU granted exports of 249,800 tonnes of soft wheat, 256,800 tonnes of barley, 16,000 tonnes of rye, 10,000 tonnes of durum, 52,500 tonnes of oats and 51,000 tonnes of maize. Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 28Jan 97     1Jul95 to 28Jan96</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  6,496     148     761    4,403	1,131</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    3,923     120	10    3,270	   13</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		246	67	 -	368	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   98	90	 -	109	    -</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	305	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   13		   -	 76	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT   10,776     126     771    8,531	1,144</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   91		 325	 16	  769</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	   289     903	 0	 32	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   -	 53	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     381     377     325	101	  769</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	    11,157     129   1,096    8,632	1,913</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     3,800     305	31    1,244	  123</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     2,635     120	 0    2,191	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  6,435     187	31    3,435	  123</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	   41     820     284	  5	2,265</p>
<p>  Food aid		  11		   -	 11	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE		52     325     284	 16	2,265</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    683	57	 3    1,191	   33</p>
<p>  Rye flour (5)	    0		   0	  0	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (5)	    0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL RYE		 683	57	 3    1,191	   33</p>
<p> OATS			322     767	 1	 42	    1</p>
<p>  Sorghum (grain)	  0		   4	  0	  844</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL SORGHUM	     0		   4	  0	  844</p>
<p>OTHER GRAINS</p>
<p>Buckwheat, Millet,</p>
<p>   Triticale		 1		 144	  1	   84</p>
<p> TOTAL GRAIN	  18,650     140   1,563   13,317	5,263</p>
<p>Note -- (1) column shows this year's exports expressed as a percentage of last year's exports, not as a percentage change (2) wheat equivalent (3) durum equivalent (4) barley equivalent (5) rye equivalent.</p>
